# The built-in markdown editor: live preview, list continuation, shortcuts, vim mode.
Output docs/images/notes.gif
Set Height 760
Source docs/demo/settings.tape

Hide
Type "/tmp/qt-seed /tmp/qt-vhs full >/dev/null; clear; ./quest" Enter
Sleep 4.2s
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "o"
Sleep 900ms
Down 8
Right 40
Enter
Enter
Type "### Video script"
Enter
Type "- [ ] Intro with the logo"
Enter
Type "Tour of the themes"
Enter
Type "Keep it short"
Sleep 300ms
Alt+b
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+S
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+T
Sleep 600ms
Type "gg"
Sleep 400ms
Type "3j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "dd"
Sleep 600ms
Type "u"
Sleep 700ms
Ctrl+F
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+G
Sleep 1.8s
Ctrl+G
Ctrl+T
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 1s
